      "question": "当英雄逝去，死亡究竟是一场毁灭还是通往永生的入口？",
      "form": "扩展奏鸣曲式（葬礼进行曲）",
      "form_en": "Expanded Sonata-Allegro Form (Funeral March)",
      "mission": "抓住C小调低音提琴狂暴的宣叙调与附点踏步，追踪E大调彼岸幻象与《震怒之日》圣咏的初现。",
      "mission_en": "Track the furious lower-string recitative and dotted march pulse, contrasting against the luminous E major consolation theme and the embryonic Dies Irae motif.",
      "introduction": "马勒第二交响曲的第一乐章《葬礼》（Totenfeier）原本是一首独立的交响音诗。乐章开篇由大提琴与低音提琴撕裂寂静，掀起一段阴冷而激昂的宣叙调。整部乐章以极其庞大的奏鸣曲式构建，充满严苛的葬礼步伐、半音阶悲叹与对生命意义的叩问。依照马勒总谱指示，第一乐章结束后必须保持至少五分钟的庄严静默。",
      "introduction_en": "Originally conceived as an independent symphonic poem ('Totenfeier'), this opening funeral rite erupts with furious lower-string recitatives. Across an immense sonata landscape, Mahler juxtaposes stern C minor funeral marches against transcendent E major visions, culminating in a subterranean collapse that demands a mandatory five-minute silence.",
