      "question": "逝者生前那些纯洁、幸福的往昔回忆，能否抚平死亡的创伤？",
      "form": "五部回旋曲式 (A-B-A'-B'-A'') / 兰德勒舞曲",
      "form_en": "Five-Part Rondo (A-B-A'-B'-A'') / Austrian Ländler",
      "mission": "在温柔摇曳的3/8拍中倾听大提琴对位线条，并在主题回归时跟看全弦乐轻巧的拨弦变奏与木管花彩。",
      "mission_en": "Follow the warm cello counter-melody under the gentle 3/8 Ländler, and enjoy the shimmering pizzicato string variation and woodwind filigree on its return.",
      "introduction": "马勒形容第二乐章是“逝者生命中一段幸福的回忆”。音乐从第一乐章的严酷深渊中抽离，转入降A大调纯真典雅的奥地利兰德勒（Ländler）舞步。大提琴倾诉深情的对位副旋律，而中段的升G小调暴风雨急流带来短暂的不安，最终在晶莹剔透的全弦乐拨弦与竖琴中消融。",
      "introduction_en": "Mahler described this movement as 'a memory from the youth of him whom we carried to the grave.' Transported to idyllic A-flat major, delicate muted violins glide through an Austrian Ländler, countered by lyrical cello song and contrasting minor-key storm episodes before dissolving in ethereal pizzicati.",
