          "title": "引子与第一部分A1（一）：定音鼓三次惊雷与单簧管《向鱼传道》起航",
          "title_en": "Intro & Section A1-I: Three Timpani Thunderbolts and Clarinet Fischpredigt Launch",
          "focus": "定音鼓独奏重击引出单簧管永动音流",
          "focus_en": "Solo Timpani Blows Launch the Perpetual Clarinet Swirl",
          "fg": "定音鼓独奏：以三记干脆冷酷的强音（ff）瞬间击碎第二乐章的温柔旧梦",
          "fg_en": "Solo Timpani: Shatter the gentle dream of Movement II with three dry, forceful ff strokes",
          "bg": "单簧管随即在弦乐十六分音符漩涡上吹出滑稽而倦怠的《圣安东尼向鱼传道》主题",
          "bg_en": "Clarinet immediately enters over swirling string sixteenths with the wry 'St. Anthony's Sermon to the Fishes' melody",
          "desc": "马勒在纲要中写道：“当你从忧郁的回忆中醒来，看周围的世界，生活变成了荒诞不经的梦魇。”定音鼓的敲击拉开了这幅讽刺世相画卷。",
          "desc_en": "Mahler wrote: 'When you wake from wistful memory and look at the world, life becomes a grotesque, ceaseless bustle.' Three sharp timpani strokes launch the ironic 3/8 whirlpool.",
