      "question": "当世界退化为一场庸碌无意义的荒诞狂欢，心灵该如何面对虚无？",
      "form": "交响谐谑曲与双三声中部 (Scherzo with Double Trio)",
      "form_en": "Symphonic Scherzo with Double Trio & Aufschrei Coda",
      "mission": "倾听单簧管永不停歇的《向鱼传道》盘旋旋律，并在乐章高潮迎接撕心裂肺的绝望尖叫和弦（Aufschrei）。",
      "mission_en": "Track the perpetual-motion 16th-note swirl of the fish sermon in clarinets and strings, culminating in the shattering B-flat minor Scream of Despair (Aufschrei).",
      "introduction": "第三乐章以两记干脆刺耳的定音鼓独奏敲击开场，随后流淌出源自《少年魔角》歌曲《圣安东尼向鱼传道》的无休止3/8拍旋律。鱼儿们听道时无比感动，道毕依然浑浑噩噩。马勒借此讽刺世俗生活的空虚与徒劳。全曲在第465小节爆发出一记震惊寰宇的“绝望尖叫和弦”（Totengreif / Aufschrei），为末日审判埋下伏笔。",
      "introduction_en": "Launched by startling solo timpani blows, this Scherzo adapts the Wunderhorn song 'St. Anthony's Sermon to the Fishes'. Sinuous, ceaseless woodwind figurations satirize the absurdity and senseless bustle of daily life, suddenly interrupted by the cataclysmic B-flat minor 'Scream of Despair' (Aufschrei).",
