      "question": "面对人间的苦难与诱惑，纯真的赤子信仰能否叩开天国之门？",
      "form": "连贯通作 lied 形式 (Through-Composed Sacred Lied)",
      "form_en": "Through-Composed Sacred Lied for Contralto and Orchestra",
      "mission": "在静止的时光中聆听女中音独唱“红玫瑰”的圣洁吟咏，伴随弱音铜管众赞歌的温暖抚慰。",
      "mission_en": "Surrender to the timeless serenity of the solo Contralto intoning 'O Röschen rot!', embraced by the muted brass chorale and celestial violin cantilena.",
      "introduction": "第三乐章结束后毫无间歇（attacca）直接进入第四乐章《原光》（Urlicht）。女低音/女中音独唱在至简的寂静中唱出“哦红玫瑰！”（O Röschen rot!）。铜管群奏出路德宗众赞歌般的宁静和声，抚慰人间最深重的苦难。这首歌曲表达了纯朴孩童般的笃定信仰：“我来自上帝，必将回归上帝！”",
      "introduction_en": "Flowing without pause (attacca) from the Scherzo, 'Urlicht' ('Primal Light') strips away symphonic complexity. A solo Contralto gently intones verses from Des Knaben Wunderhorn, accompanied by solemn brass chorales and ethereal violin counterpoint, asserting unwavering faith: 'I am from God and will return to God!'",
      "color": "#f59e0b",
      "duration": 320.21,
      "barCount": 140,
      "audio": "assets/movement-4.mp3",
      "originalTitle": "IV. \"Urlicht\". Sehr feierlich, aber schlicht",
