          "title": "女低音独唱深情劝慰：“啊，相信吧，我的心，你没有白白受苦！”（收束：乐句解决与下一段落伏笔）",
          "title_en": "Contralto Solo Consolation: \"O Believe, My Heart, Nothing Is Lost to You!\" (Phase D: Cadential Resolution & Structural Bridge)",
          "focus": "女低音独唱（Magdalena Kožená）唱响马勒亲笔续写的信仰诗篇 · 句尾和声收拢与下一阶段动机预备",
          "focus_en": "Contralto Solo (Magdalena Kožená) Sings Mahler's Own Verses of Faith · Cadential convergence and preparation for the next anchor",
          "fg": "女低音独唱：以温暖而急切的真挚情感唱出马勒自己撰写的诗句：“啊，相信吧，我的心！你的一切渴望皆属于你！”",
          "fg_en": "Contralto Solo: Sings Mahler's own verses with warm, urgent conviction: 'O believe, my heart, nothing is lost to you! Yours is what you longed for!'",
          "bg": "小提琴与大提琴以饱满的连奏与人声对位，圆号在下方温暖支撑",
          "bg_en": "Violins and cellos entwine in rich legato counterpoint while horns support warmly below",
          "desc": "从第560小节起，马勒放下克洛普施托克的原诗，用自己的亲笔诗句直抒胸臆：“凡生者必死，凡死者必复活！”（本段聚焦第602–615小节：句尾和声收拢与下一阶段动机预备。）",
          "desc_en": "From bar 560 onward, Mahler sets his own deeply personal verses: 'You were not born in vain, you have not lived and suffered in vain!' (Bars 602–615: Cadential convergence and preparation for the next anchor.)",
          "roles_zh": {
            "voices": "女低音独唱充满人性温度地抚慰受苦的心灵",
            "strings": "弦乐声部与女低音展开深情的复调对话",
            "horns": "圆号提供醇厚的和声怀抱"
          },
          "roles_en": {
            "voices": "Contralto solo consoles the suffering heart with profound warmth",
            "strings": "Strings engage in ardent contrapuntal dialogue with the voice",
            "horns": "Horns provide a rich harmonic embrace"
          },
          "cue_zh": "对比刚才合唱团超然的宗教圣洁感与此处女低音充满人性热血的倾诉；关注句尾余音如何无缝引出下一个排练号的关键转折",
          "cue_en": "Contrast the chorus's transcendent stillness with the contralto's warm human urgency; Follow how the phrase cadence sets up the next rehearsal landmark",
          "vocal_text": {
            "de": "O glaube, mein Herz, o glaube: Es geht dir nichts verloren! Dein ist, ja dein, was du gesehnt! Du hast nicht umsonst gelebt, gelitten!",
            "zh": "啊，相信吧，我的心，相信吧：你的一切都不会失落！你所渴望的，终归属于你！你并未徒然活着、徒然受苦！",
            "en": "O believe, my heart, O believe: nothing is lost to you! Yours is what you longed for! You have not lived and suffered in vain!"
          },
          "interpolated_sec": 1679.5,
          "onset_adjustment_sec": 0.0,
          "start": 1679.5,
          "foreground": "女低音独唱：以温暖而急切的真挚情感唱出马勒自己撰写的诗句：“啊，相信吧，我的心！你的一切渴望皆属于你！”",
