      "question": "末日终结之后，谁将被审判？谁能获得永恒的复活？",
      "form": "宏大末世狂想音画与合唱康塔塔 (Apocalyptic Fresco & Choral Cantata)",
      "form_en": "Monumental Apocalyptic Fresco & Choral Cantata",
      "mission": "辨识旷野呼喊的后台铜管（Fernorchester），等待极弱pppp无伴奏合唱《复活》的进入，直至管风琴与全钟齐鸣的巅峰辉煌。",
      "mission_en": "Follow the three-dimensional spatial dialogue between onstage orchestra and offstage brass (Der Grosse Appell), the whispered pppp choral entry, and the overwhelming organ and bell apotheosis.",
      "introduction": "长达35分钟的浩瀚终曲是整部交响曲的精神顶峰。谐谑曲绝望尖叫再度撕裂苍穹，随后荒野号角与《震怒之日》圣咏宣告末日降临。坟墓裂开，死者苏醒踏着庄严步伐前进。当人类全部站在虚空之中，没有惩罚，没有审判——柏林广播合唱团以极弱（pppp）的神秘音响唱出克洛普施托克的诗句：“复活，是的，你必将复活！”在女高音与女中音独唱的交织中，管风琴、钟声与全管弦乐爆发出宇宙重生的灿烂光芒！",
      "introduction_en": "The monumental 35-minute Finale represents Mahler's ultimate metaphysical triumph. After apocalyptic fanfares, offstage brass calls (The Great Summons), and the March of the Dead, absolute silence falls. The choir enters whispered pppp: 'Aufersteh'n, ja aufersteh'n wirst du!' Joined by soprano and contralto soloists, the music builds to an ecstatic apotheosis crowned by deep bells and full pipe organ.",
      "color": "#e11d48",
      "duration": 2103.0,
