    "sourcesInterp_en": "The files are attributed to the 2010 Rattle/BPO recording but contain only encoder tags. The orchestra’s official catalog lists Movement I at 24:16, versus the bundled 22:34, a 102-second discrepancy. Alignment applies to the bundled files; the complete official release is not authenticated."
