  "overview": {
    "oneSentence": "在第一乐章英雄葬礼的巨大深渊之上，走过兰德勒回忆、世俗荒诞与原初神圣之光，最终在无伴奏弱音合唱与全宇宙的管风琴轰鸣中完成终极复活。",
    "parts": [
      {
        "part": "I",
        "movements": [
          1
        ],
        "label": "葬礼之祭 (Totenfeier)",
        "label_en": "Funeral Rites (Totenfeier)",
        "listenFor": "第一乐章独占第一部分；严酷的C小调附点进行曲步伐与泰坦英雄遗体的安葬，结尾总谱指示必须静默五分钟。",
        "listenFor_en": "Movement 1 stands alone as Part I; stern C minor funeral march and the solemn burial of the titan, followed by Mahler's mandatory five-minute silence."
      },
      {
        "part": "II",
        "movements": [
          2,
          3
        ],
        "label": "回忆与世俗迷局",
        "label_en": "Retrospective Memory & Worldly Absurdity",
        "listenFor": "降A大调兰德勒舞步的温柔旧梦，与圣安东尼向鱼传道的荒诞旋涡交织，直至绝望尖叫和弦（Aufschrei）。",
        "listenFor_en": "Gentle nostalgic recollections in the A-flat Ländler followed by the ceaseless Wunderhorn fish sermon, culminating in the shattering Scream of Despair."
      },
      {
        "part": "III",
        "movements": [
          4,
          5
        ],
        "label": "原光与终极复活",
        "label_en": "Primal Light & Universal Resurrection",
        "listenFor": "女低音独唱《原光》质朴虔诚的信仰，引出终曲末日审判的号角、无伴奏合唱《复活》与管风琴终极大合唱。",
        "listenFor_en": "Intimate spiritual longing in Urlicht yields to the vast apocalyptic fresco: offstage brass calls, whispered choral entry, and full pipe organ apotheosis."
      }
    ]
  },
